---
import { ShieldCheck, Award, Users, ArrowRight, Sparkles } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-[#224da8]/5 via-neutral-50/30 to-white py-16 md:py-24" id="hero-section">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-[#224da8]/10 blur-[100px] opacity-70 animate-pulse"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-12 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-[#ff6634]/10 blur-[100px] opacity-60 animate-pulse"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full bg-blue-100/30 blur-[130px] opacity-50"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#80808008_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#80808008_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:20px_20px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-center lg:text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#224da8]/10 text-[#224da8] text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide">
          <Sparkles className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#ff6634] fill-[#ff6634]" />
          <span>Solusi Jasa Advertising Termurah di Kota Palembang</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-neutral-900 leading-[1.1]" id="hero-title">
          Kembangkan Bisnis bersama <span class="text-[#224da8]">Sriwijaya</span> <span class="text-[#ff6634]">Grafika</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">
          Cetak media promosi impian Anda dan jadilah bisnis paling elegan di Kota Palembang. Kami melayani pembuatan
          <strong> Huruf Timbul LED</strong>, <strong>Neon Box</strong>, <strong>Papan Nama Toko</strong>, serta
          aneka kebutuhan percetakan kantor terlengkap sejak tahun 2008.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 py-2 text-center max-w-md mx-auto lg:mx-0">
          <div class="border border-neutral-100 rounded-xl bg-white p-3 shadow-sm">
            <span class="block text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#224da8]">16+</span>
            <span class="block text-[10px] font-mono tracking-wider font-semibold text-neutral-400 uppercase">Tahun Dedikasi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-neutral-100 rounded-xl bg-white p-3 shadow-sm">
            <span class="block text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#ff6634]">1 Thn</span>
            <span class="block text-[10px] font-mono tracking-wider font-semibold text-neutral-400 uppercase">Garansi Penuh</span>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-neutral-100 rounded-xl bg-white p-3 shadow-sm">
            <span class="block text-2xl font-extrabold text-indigo-600">Free</span>
            <span class="block text-[10px] font-mono tracking-wider font-semibold text-neutral-400 uppercase">Biaya Desain*</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href="/layanan"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-[#224da8] hover:bg-[#183c84] text-white font-bold text-base shadow-lg shadow-[#224da8]/20 transition-all duration-200 group"
            id="btn-explore-services"
          >
            <span>Lihat Layanan</span>
            <ArrowRight className="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative mt-8 lg:mt-0">
        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-sm rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden p-6 text-white border border-neutral-800">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[#ff6634]/15 rounded-full blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-800 pb-4 mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
              <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></span>
              <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-400 font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">
              BENGKEL PRODUKSI AKTIF
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-800/50 border border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed font-mono">
                "Kami melayani sepenuh hati dari pesanan satu huruf timbul hingga billboard raksasa. Hubungi marketing kami dan buktikan garansi 1 tahun penuh untuk kualitas tepercaya."
              </p>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-right text-neutral-300">- M. Edy Munandar (Owner)</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 pt-2 text-xs">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-200">
                <ShieldCheck className="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 flex-shrink-0" />
                <span>Garansi Kelistrikan &amp; Fisik 12 Bulan penuh</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-200">
                <Award className="w-4 h-4 text-[#ff6634] flex-shrink-0" />
                <span>Presisi tinggi dengan mesin laser cutting ACP</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-200">
                <Users className="w-4 h-4 text-sky-400 flex-shrink-0" />
                <span>Pemberdayaan sosial (SDM tunarungu terlatih)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
